---
const qas = [
  {
    q: "I've tried programs before and stayed stuck.",
    a: "You probably did everything those programs told you. Tara nobody ever watched you do it. A PDF can't see your lat engagement. A video can't catch the half rep you're cutting. That's the difference here. You film, I watch, I tell you the one thing to fix. Tesaile the same effort finally moves the number.",
  },
  {
    q: "I'm already strong. Will this even help me?",
    a: "If you're stuck, it helps, wherever you're stuck. The program scales to your number, not a beginner's. The guy at 27 chasing 35 runs the same system as the guy at 17 chasing 25. Same leaks, different bar. Tara if you could've broken the plateau alone, you'd have done it by now. That's not effort. That's needing a second set of eyes.",
  },
  {
    q: "What if I miss a few days?",
    a: "Real life happens. Miss a training day, you pick the week's Drop back up, no drama. The rest weeks are built in on purpose. Missing a session won't break your 60 days. Skipping the Form Check will, because then I'm coaching you blind. Train when you can. Just send the Checks.",
  },
];
---

<section class="bg-black-2 py-16 md:py-24" aria-label="What if">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl">

    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Straight Answers</p>
    <h2 class="headline text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
      What if...
    </h2>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-10">
      {qas.map(({ q, a }) => (
        <div>
          <p class="text-lg font-medium text-bone sm:text-xl">{q}</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-base text-stone">{a}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
